\"main-content\"><div class=\"blog-page-wrap\"><section class=\"blog-hero\" style=\"max-width:900px\"><nav class=\"blog-eyebrow reveal\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Home</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><a href=\"/blog\" class=\"blog-eyebrow-link\">Blog</a><span class=\"blog-crumb-sep\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&middot;</span><span class=\"blog-crumb-current\" aria-current=\"page\">Occasions</span></nav><h1 class=\"reveal delay-1\">Photo booth ideas for weddings, birthdays and <span class=\"accent\">holidays</span></h1><p class=\"blog-hero-sub reveal delay-2\">Weddings, birthdays, graduations and the entire holiday calendar - with the planning details most guides leave out.</p></section><nav class=\"blog-filter\" aria-label=\"Browse by category\"><ul class=\"blog-filter-list\"><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog\">All articles</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/guides\">Guides</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/ideas\">Ideas</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/occasions\" aria-current=\"page\">Occasions</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/long-distance\">Long Distance</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/photography\">Photography</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/culture\">Culture</a></li><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/category/studio\">Studio</a></li></ul></nav><h2 class=\"blog-count\">8 articles in Occasions &amp; Events</h2>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"blog-index-container\"><div class=\"blog-grid blog-grid-4\"><a href=\"/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-480.avif?v=f8d54f3e 480w, /assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-640.avif?v=96c56492 640w, /assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-960.avif?v=ce6beffb 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-480.webp?v=9ddfb8c2 480w, /assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-640.webp?v=376d4d6b 640w, /assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=41099d79 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/baby-shower-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=41099d79\" alt=\"Illustration of a baby shower photo booth setup with guests\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>18 Baby Shower Photo Booth Ideas</h3><p>Low-effort ideas built around a guest of honour with limited energy - including the advice book that replaces a guest book.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-480.avif?v=56bf4cb6 480w, /assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-640.avif?v=d8862de0 640w, /assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-960.avif?v=4d0ce32e 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-480.webp?v=65e4088a 480w, /assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-640.webp?v=f8d4535d 640w, /assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=a441e004 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/valentines-day-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=a441e004\" alt=\"Illustration of a couple's photo strip for Valentine's Day\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>22 Valentine's Day Photo Ideas for Couples</h3><p>For couples together and apart, for people who find the occasion silly, and for spending it alone.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-480.avif?v=13c4f069 480w, /assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-640.avif?v=abd6a542 640w, /assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-960.avif?v=f8853781 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-480.webp?v=c0047391 480w, /assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-640.webp?v=bd72e06b 640w, /assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=eb0711fa 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/new-year-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=eb0711fa\" alt=\"Illustration of a New Year countdown photo booth scene\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>18 New Year's Eve Photo Booth Ideas</h3><p>Strips built around the countdown, annual traditions worth starting, and how to shoot in a dark room full of moving people.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-480.avif?v=1990b5d9 480w, /assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-640.avif?v=35daa81a 640w, /assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-960.avif?v=4ac1bc22 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-480.webp?v=35c6db73 480w, /assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-640.webp?v=911732cf 640w, /assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=d3d537b3 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/halloween-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=d3d537b3\" alt=\"Illustration of a Halloween photo booth with costumes and dramatic lighting\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>20 Halloween Photo Booth Ideas</h3><p>Costumes, parties, children and celebrating apart - starting with how to light a costume in a dark room without flattening it.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-480.avif?v=44dd2a1d 480w, /assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-640.avif?v=f2391d81 640w, /assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-960.avif?v=d15f5066 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-480.webp?v=f282303e 480w, /assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-640.webp?v=ab3489ac 640w, /assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=5e13c431 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/christmas-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=5e13c431\" alt=\"Illustration of a festive photo booth scene with tree lights\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>20 Christmas Photo Booth Ideas</h3><p>For the day, the run-up and Christmases spent apart - starting with the lighting fix that solves most December photographs.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/graduation-photo-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-480.avif?v=12f02b05 480w, /assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-640.avif?v=17e90ec2 640w, /assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-960.avif?v=bd0da85f 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-480.webp?v=500c091a 480w, /assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-640.webp?v=bf4c7c06 640w, /assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=16a7a58d 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/graduation-photo-ideas-960.webp?v=16a7a58d\" alt=\"Illustration of graduation caps and photo strips\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>18 Graduation Photo Ideas Beyond the Cap and Gown</h3><p>Including the ones to take in the weeks before the ceremony - which is where the photographs you actually keep come from.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-480.avif?v=ec475b4e 480w, /assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-640.avif?v=31f6e34d 640w, /assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-960.avif?v=1544335e 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-480.webp?v=affdab00 480w, /assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-640.webp?v=1f1bea48 640w, /assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=cf4e1e01 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/birthday-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=cf4e1e01\" alt=\"Illustration of a birthday photo booth with cake and confetti\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>20 Birthday Photo Booth Ideas Worth Repeating</h3><p>For the party, for milestones, for birthdays spent apart - and the annual ritual that only pays off over a decade.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a><a href=\"/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas\" class=\"blog-grid-card\" data-category=\"occasions\"><div class=\"blog-grid-image\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-480.avif?v=e588e512 480w, /assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-640.avif?v=431a6b8f 640w, /assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-960.avif?v=2254dc49 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-480.webp?v=39403d65 480w, /assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-640.webp?v=a66ceabe 640w, /assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=0d579370 960w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 463px\"><img src=\"/assets/blog/wedding-photo-booth-ideas-960.webp?v=0d579370\" alt=\"Illustration of a wedding photo booth with guests and props\" width=\"960\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></picture></div><div class=\"blog-grid-content\"><h3>Wedding Photo Booth Ideas That Actually Get Used</h3><p>Placement, timing, the photo strip guest book, and the five mistakes that leave a wedding booth sitting empty all evening.</p><span class=\"blog-read-btn\">Read Article &rarr;</span></div></a></div></section>\n\n\n<section class=\"blog-hub-more\" aria-labelledby=\"more-topics\"><h2 id=\"more-topics\" class=\"blog-hub-more-title\">Browse by topic</h2><ul class=\"blog-hub-more-list\"><li><a class=\"blog-filter-chip\" href=\"/blog/tag/photo-strips\">Photo Strips<